If a clinician dismisses a patient on a PDMP-information-basis then the clinician can adversely affect a patient-safety and can cause a missed-lifesaving-information-opportunity and can cause a missed-lifesaving-intervention-opportunity.
A lifesaving-information-example includes a prescription-opioid-risk-information-example and includes an overdose-prevention-information-example.
A lifesaving-intervention-example includes a safer-prescription-example and includes a nonopioid-pain-treatment-example and includes a naloxone-example and includes an effective-substance-use-disorder-treatment-example.
